    <string name="disclosure_title">What this permission does</string>
    <string name="disclosure_full">Reads the current page to find the next button and detect changes, then performs your chosen taps or scrolls\n\nNo screenshots are taken and page content is not saved or uploaded\nOnly checking for updates connects to GitHub\n\nEnabling permission does not start turning pages\nTap the dot or Start to begin\nTouch the screen to pause, or turn off the service in Android settings</string>
